    "title": "Importance of International Linkages for Local Know-How Flows: Some Econometric Evidence From Belgium",
    "title_zh": "国际联系对本地知识流动的重要性：来自比利时的若干计量经济学证据",
    "translation_status": "title_translated_cached",
